Dear all,

here's my cautionary note for the day ...

Sometimes the simple Rhat, as computed by many software including JAGS when running it with jagsUI, can be really misleading as a convergence criterion, as these plots show:

Solution: always check out at least some traceplots. Or (as Matt H. would argue), use more refined versions of Rhat such as split-chain Rhat ...

Best regards  --- Marc

